  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (ADR-0039, merged in PR #4181): confidence becomes pure detection reliability with a confidence_source enum, so the 0.40-floor breach on dispatches_to is fixed by re-deriving the values under the new model rather than patching the old hardcoded ones; ranking adjustments move to rank_score. Waits on the ADR-0039 implementation."  # dd7e
