- op: discuss  # c3af
  at: '2026-07-13T00:08:08Z'  # c3af
  by: agent  # c3af
  actor: jgstern_agent  # c3af
  clock: 6  # c3af
  nonce: c3af  # c3af
  message: "FIXED in PR (ADR-0039 rulings 1 & 3). Root cause: the type-hierarchy linker fused a 1/sqrt(N) fan-out dampener (WI-kabom) + a 0.30 test-file penalty (WI-supok) into Edge.confidence, driving it to ~0.094 — 4x below the documented 0.40 linker floor on 313 edges. Fix: a dispatch to an override IS a real relationship, so confidence now derives the flat in-band 0.85 type_hierarchy base (seeded in the evidence registry; confidence_source=evidence_derived), and the dampener + penalty relocate INTACT to the new Edge.rank_score. The ranking filter (filter_edges_for_ranking, invoked at min_edge_confidence=0.5) re-keys from confidence to rank_score, so high-fan-out dispatch edges are still demoted out of centrality (WI-kabom signal unchanged; proved by test_min_edge_confidence_keys_on_rank_score). Behavioral evidence (self-analysis, hypergumbo run .): 334 type_hierarchy dispatches_to edges ALL at 0.85 evidence_derived; 0 below the 0.40 floor (was 313); 0 below the 0.30 floor (was 236); rank_score carries the dampened values (0.094/0.097/0.30/...). Tagged awaits_bakeoff_validation."  # c3af
