  message: "BAKEOFF-VALIDATED: moved -> tag stripped. DEEP cohort deep-20260623-134237 iter-003 (schema 0.14.6 / confidence_model evidence-v2, post-thread-A), 8 repos: express/caddy/spring-petclinic/zoxide/SwiftyJSON/sherpa-csharp/apollo-server/pretix. type_hierarchy 'dispatches_to' edges = flat confidence 0.85 (>=0.40 floor; was ~0.05-0.32) on all repos that emit the construct (caddy 501, pretix 2197, apollo 7; n/a on the other 5); the 1/sqrt(N) fan-out dampener relocated to rank_score (min ~0.048-0.32). Correct downstream effect: these edges now pass the 0.5 reliability threshold so avg_slice_nodes INCREASED (e.g. apollo 40->97, pretix 258->314) — slice growth, not a regression."  # 0163
